    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"bbttcc-doctrine-desc\"><h3>Establish Siege Camp</h3><p>Stamp the 'Beached Camp' modifier on a target hex (must be owned, neutral, or claimable by the attacker). Hex qualifies as a temporary siege depot for the duration of the attacker's active siege; auto-clears on siege resolution. Used for naval/wilderness sieges where no permanent depot is in range.</p><p><strong>OP Cost:</strong> violence 10, logistics 20</p><p><strong>Tier:</strong> 1</p><p><strong>Rarity:</strong> uncommon</p></div>",
